Description: This package collates a set of functions that staff at The Lab @ DC use frequently, and sets standard themes for plots and figures. The package is being built iteratively, and focuses on data visualization, standardization, and DC-specific problems. The package is meant to be used internally by Lab @ DC and Lab @ DDOT staff. 
